    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "23 Rathmore is situated in the village of Aughrim, in south-east County Wicklow. An attractive rural area known for its wooded valleys, rivers, mountain scenery and traditional village character. Aughrim sits where the Ow and Derry rivers meet to form the Aughrim River and is surrounded by the Wicklow countryside.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, an attractive 3 bedroom detached bungalow situated within one of Aughrim's most desirable residential developments. \r\nOffering bright and spacious accommodation, this well-maintained home is ideal for families, first-time buyers, or those wishing to downsize. \r\n\r\n Generous off-street parking with additional parking space to the front of the house, landscaped garden to the front, private enclosed garden to the rear."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation Includes:\r\nEntrance Hall\r\n2.058m x 7.523m\r\nCarpet flooring, bright welcoming entrance hall, hot press and access to all accommodation. \r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\n4.810m x 5.016m\r\nSpacious living room with large bay window providing excellent natural light, feature open fireplace with timber surround and cast-iron insert, carpet flooring and double doors leading to the kitchen/dining area.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining \r\n3.879m x 6.060\r\nBright fitted kitchen with ample wall and floor units, tiled flooring, tiled splash back, integrated oven and hob, generous dining area and back door providing direct access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom \r\n3.992m x 3.223m\r\nLarge double bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobes and window overlooking the rear garden\r\nEn-suite\r\n0.891m x 3.200m\r\nFully tiled shower enclosure with electric shower, WC, wash hand basin and tiled flooring.\r\n\r\n2nd Bedroom \r\n3.691m x 3.212m\r\nSpacious double bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobe and large window allowing plenty of natural light.\r\n\r\n3rd Bedroom\r\n2.879m x 2.827m\r\nAmple sized double bedroom overlooking rear garden, carpeted floor, plenty of natural light.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\n2.177m x 3.192m\r\nLarge tiled bathroom comprising bath with overhead shower, WC, wash hand basin and window providing natural ventilation and light.\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\n14.605m x 8.812m\r\nPrivate enclosed rear garden with 2 side entrances. Mainly laid in lawn and offers a spacious area for outdoor dining."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Features Include:\r\n•\tBuilt in Fireplace\r\n•\tPrivate enclosed rear garden\r\n•\tOff-street parking\r\n•\tWalking distance to Aughrim village\r\n\r\nServices Include\r\n•\tOil Fired central heating\r\n•\tMains Sewerage\r\n•\tMains Water"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
